**Button** (Nike 시그니처 — pill 9999px)
```css
.btn { font: 700 14px/1 'Trade Gothic',Inter,'Helvetica Neue',sans-serif; letter-spacing:-0.01em; border-radius: 9999px; padding: 12px 24px; border: 0; cursor: pointer; }
